                <description>According to its banner, the version of PHP installed on the remote host is older than
                    5.2.10. Such versions are reportedly affected by multiple vulnerabilities :

                    - Sufficient checks are not performed on fields reserved for offsets in function &apos;exif_read_data()&apos;.
